  "memo": "Theo: confirms fallback (printed list + listening event) if under 12–15 excerpts from five contributors; build hours on hold. Will total labeled estimates against 3,000. Open: payment amount, event for all twelve, Leila's estimate; kiosk postponed if unaffordable."
